        "custom_liquid_h3ngxW": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"blocky-product-description\" style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 18px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0rem; margin-bottom: 0rem; line-height: 1.8; letter-spacing: 0.6px;\">\n<p><strong>A gift that plays itself when it rains.</strong></p>\n  <p>🌧 Set it outside and steady rain plays it. Eleven tuned notes in one scale, so every drop sounds like it belongs.</p>\n  <p>🎵 Nothing to learn, nothing to tune. Every song in the guide book is a list of numbers.</p>\n  <p>🎁 7 free bonuses with every drum: padded bag, guide book, mallets, finger picks, stickers, pouch and cloth.</p>\n</div>"
